  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Support to Local Authorities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This action will continue INTPA&#xbf;s engagement with LAs, Associations of Local Authorities (ALAs) and other actors supporting LAs capacity building, including in i) policy dialogue at local, national, regional and global levels, including with EU delegations, to be recognised as development actors, ii) meaningful contribution, financial mobilisation and infrastructure management to increase their added value in Global Gateway projects. This action will allow LAs to benefit from an enabling environment, to deliver on their mandate and, in fine, to improve the living conditions of their constituencies.</narrative>
  </description>
